      "section_id": "kohler-volume-1:p0155-p0156:s00:x00",
      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "                                              Coehlearia officinalis L.\n\n              Loffelkraut, Scharbocksheil, Skorbutkraut                            — Scurvy-grass — Coehlearia,\n               Familie: Cruciferae.              Gattung: Coehlearia L.",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "學名 Coehlearia officinalis L.，十字花科，俗名 Loffelkraut、Scharbocksheil。",
      "evidence_indexes": [
        0
      ],
      "source_locator": {
        "source_id": "kohler-volume-1",
        "volume": 1,
        "pdf_page": 155,
